    "description": "4 Unit Lone Mountain Property with TWO VACANT Top Floor 2 bedroom units. Perfect for an Owner User or An Investor Looking to Find Their Own Tenants. Experience the pinnacle of urban living at 838 Arguello Blvd, San Francisco. This property boasts four 2 bedroom 1 bath units with open kitchen, each offering a sanctuary of comfort and style. Embrace the opportunity to make your mark in the two vacant top floor 2-bed, 1-bath units, featuring new luxury vinyl flooring and an open kitchen layout that invites culinary exploration and effortless entertaining. Parking is a breeze with the convenience of five dedicated spaces, ensuring you and your guests always arrive with ease. One space is offered to someone outside of the building for $200 per month.  Coin operated laundry & Additional storage in the backyard provides ample room for stowing away belongings. Nestled in a prime location, this residence offers easy access to the vibrant energy of San Francisco, with renowned dining, shopping, and cultural attractions just moments away. Enjoy the convenience of urban living and all that Lone Mountain and the Richmond offers while relishing in the tranquility of this charming neighborhood. Excellent opportunity to own in the heart of San Francisco in one of the most desirable locations"
